 three units on this floor\"},{\"text\":\"Two of the three units on this floor alarm at the same set point.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"two of them alarm at the\\nsame set point\"},{\"text\":\"Ice on the door seal holds the door open by a few millimetres.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"Ice on the seal holds the door open by a few\\nmillimetres and is the usual cause of a slow rise.\"},{\"text\":\"Ice on the door seal is the usual cause of a slow rise.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"Ice on the seal holds the door open by a few\\nmillimetres and is the usual cause of a slow rise.\"},{\"text\":\"The on-call technician should be called if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after arrival.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Call the on-call technician if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after\\nyou arrive.\"},{\"text\":\"When calling the on-call technician, give the unit name, the reading taken on arrival and the current reading.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"Give the unit name, the reading you took on arrival and the reading\\nnow.\"},{\"text\":\"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong.\"},{\"text\":\"An alarm with no line in the freezer log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"An\\nalarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended.\"},{\"text\":\"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday until 08:00 on Monday.\",\"line\":27,\"span\":\"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday\\nuntil 08:00 on Monday.\"}]}","ttft_ms":6373,"type":"result","duration_ms":6490,"uuid":"338451dd-92cf-48b4-940a-bcadfbe21d73","ttft_stream_ms":1459,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":1460,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
